DESCRIPTION:Indigenous Peoples Day Powwow Committee34th Annual Berkeley In
 digenous Peoples Day\nPowwow & Indian Market\n534 Years of Resistance & Re
 newal\n\nBerkeley’s Indigenous Peoples Day Committee invites the public 
 to celebrate the 34th Annual Indigenous Peoples Day Powwow & Indian Market
  on Saturday\, October 10\, 2026\, at M.L.K. Civic Center Park from 10:00 
 am to 6:00 pm. This free\, family-friendly celebration will bring together
  Native American dancers\, drummers\, artists\, craftspeople\, food vendor
 s\, and community members for a day of culture\, ceremony\, celebration\, 
 and community.\nThe Powwow will feature powwow dancing and drumming\, alon
 g with competition dancing. There will also be Gourd dancing and songs\, d
 ance specials\, Intertribals and Round Dances that everyone is invited to 
 join. Children are welcome.\nWhat:\nBerkeley’s 34th Annual Indigenous Pe
 oples Day Powwow & Indian Market\nWhen:\nSaturday\, October 10\, 2026\n10 
 a.m.– 6 p.m.\nGrand Entry: 1 p.m.\nWhere:\nM.L.K. Civic Center Park\nAll
 ston Way at M.L. King\, Jr. Way\nBerkeley\, California\nHead Staff\nCo-MCs
 : Randy Pico (Luiseño) & Aurora Mamea (Blackfeet)\nHead Man: Daniel Leroy
  (Omaha/Ponca/Pomo)\nHead Lady: Alexa Gorospe (Laguna Pueblo/Ohkay’Owing
 eh)\nArena Director: JoeFox Hopper (Pomo/Laguna Pueblo/Native Hawaiian)\nH
 ost Northern Drum: All Nations (Oakland\, CA)\nHost Southern Drum: So Ex S
 tyle (Manteca\, CA)\nHead Gourd Dancer: Frankie Hoskie Jr. (Diné/Apache)\
 nAll Powwow drums and dancers are welcome.\nSpecial Events\nHead Man’s G
 rass Special All...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/events/17
 72629940588616/?acontext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A%5B%7B%22surface%
 22%3A%22home%22%7D%2C%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22search_results%22%2C%22surfac
 e%22%3A%22search%22%7D%5D%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D\nDetails: https
 ://sf.funcheap.com/34th-annual-indigenous-peoples-day-powwow-indian-market
 -berkeley/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IPD-PW
 -Flyer-9.4.2026-1-latest.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T204148Z
LOCATION:Martin Luther King Jr. Civic Center Park\, 2151 Martin Luther Kin
 g Jr Way\, Berkeley
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/34th-annual-indigenous-peoples-day-powwow-indi
 an-market-berkeley/
END:VEVENT
