 trero Hill Neighborhood House in San Francisco\, bakers will compete for t
 he prize of Best Pie in San Francisco\, judged by a panel of bakers and co
 mmunity members with a taste for pie.\nSample from pies made by home baker
 s bringing their flakiest crusts and luscious fillings. Attendees can vote
  for which pie receives the People’s Choice Award\, and our judges will 
 award the Best in Show.\n\nThis in-person event is perfect for anyone who 
 loves pies—whether you bake\, taste\, or just enjoy the sweet community.
  Don’t miss out on the chance to celebrate some seriously awesome pie ma
 gic!\n\nIf you are a baker who wants to compete\, apply on our website (no
