 n Martinez\, and they’re on a quest for craft beer! Join us for a spookt
 acular event where zombies will roam the downtown corridor\, sampling 30+ 
 craft beers from various breweries stationed at participating small busine
 sses.\nCostume Contest: Embrace the undead spirit! While zombie costumes a
 re optional\, we encourage you to unleash your inner zombie. Prizes will b
 e awarded for the best individual costumes and the most outstanding group 
 ensemble. Enter the contest during the beer tasting\, and winners will be 
 announced immediately after the event at Main Street Plaza.\nDon’t miss 
 this hauntingly hoppy event! Whether you’re a craft beer enthusiast\, a 
 lover of the supernatural\, or just looking for a frightfully good time\, 
 the Downtown Martinez Zombie Beer Walk is the place to be. Grab your tasti
 ng pass\, perfect your zombie shuffle\, and join us for a day of otherworl
 dly fun!\n\nParticipating Businesses and Breweries Coming Soon!\nMust be 2
 1 years or older to sample beer. DD’s are free! Must have valid ID.\nDow
 ntown Martinez & Co. thanks you in advance for drinking responsibly and en
 courages you to pre arrange a designated driver or take Uber or Lyft.\n\n$
 45.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/162566/t/tickets\nDetails:
  https://sf.funcheap.com/14th-annual-zombie-brew-crawl-downtown-martinez/\
