DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizersylvia holdenTucked along the 
 Carquinez Strait\, Crockett is inviting the Bay Area to discover its indep
 endent shops\, vintage finds\, local artists\, and small-town charm.\nOn S
 aturday\, October 17\, from noon to 5 PM\, Walk It Shop It brings together
