 oscience activities\, the Community Memory Wall\, brain-health demonstrati
 ons\, prizes\, food and cold brew\, and more.\nThe Community Day is part o
 f Brain Brew’s three-event brain health campaign across San Francisco. O
 n October 17\, the team will cycle a 22.4-mile route tracing the shape of 
