 cisco’s iconic Ferry Building\, showcasing the freshest fall produce fro
 m Foodwise’s farmers markets. Support local farms\, community food acces
 s\, and youth education\, and do it deliciously.\n\nOpening Reception\nKic
 k off the night with hors d’oeuvres\, hand-crafted drinks\, and a behind
 -the-scenes peek at the action-packed kitchen.\n\nFour-Course Feast\nGathe
