DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer“Wiener Wednesday” Free Ho
 t Dog Night at Rye (SF)\n@ryebarsf\nWith a name like “Rye\,” this bar 
 is obviously whiskey-centric… but on Wednesday nights the bar leans towa
 rds tequila is also awesomely hot dog centric!\nCome to Rye Bar every Wedn
 esday for free hot dogs with every Hornitos cocktail purchase. Mo and Kat 
 are you bartenders and hot dog slingers for the night (combining their lov
 e of hot dogs and tequila)\, and will pair the perfect cocktail for you fo
 r hot doggin’ all night. And your pet dogs are welcome\, too!\n\nWiener 
 Wednesday\nEvery Wednesday\, 6pm to close\nRye Bar\, 688 Geary St. at Leav
 enworth\, SF\nFree hot dog with every Hornitos cocktail or shot purchase\n
 \nPlus load up on all the fixin’s like onions\, tomato\, mustard\, mayo\
 , ketchup\, relish\, jalapenos… you name it\, they probably have it!\nGl
 uten free? Just ask! They usually have non-bread buns!\n\nFree hot dog wit
 h any Hornitos cocktail like margaritas\, palomas\, tequila shots or order
  the delish “Dying Word” cocktail with coconut fat washed Hornitos\, c
 oconut liquor\, pineapple gomme syrup\, lime\, angostura and cardamom bitt
 ers.\nRye has been in operation since 2006. A pioneer in the cocktail move
 ment\, tried to avoid speakeasy style stuff and be an everyman bar. We wan
 t the neighborhood people and tourists alike to feel at home. Want a craft
  cocktail? Sure\, shot and beer? Sure! Learn more at @ryebarsf\n\nView thi
 s post on Instagram\n\nA post shared by Rye Bar San Francisco (@ryebarsf)\
 n\nUpcoming “Wiener...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/C
 ZLoFlPrx8T/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/wiener-wednesday-free-hot-do
 g-night-at-rye-sf-232/\nSource: Funcheap SF
