 ls: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/23/midnight-at-the-masquerade-murd
 er-mystery-dinner-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://
 sf.funcheap.com/midnight-masquerade-murder-mystery-dinner-westin-st-franci
 s/
