CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
DESCRIPTION:Think you can tell Fiji from Evian in a blind tasting? Know yo
 ur Topo from your Pellegrino just from looking at the bubbles? Have you ev
 er tried salty sparkling Spanish Vichy Catalan\, or experienced the bizarr
 e Borjomi from the Republic of Georgia?\n\nBottled waters differ dramatica
 lly in texture\, minerality\, carbonation\, and finish. We’ll try lots o
 f waters - some familiar and some super weird- and we’ll learn Why they 
 taste the way they do in this alcohol-free experience.\n\nWe’ll start by
  blind tasting San Francisco tap to see if Hetch Hetchy is as heavenly as 
 we’ve heard about. We’ll continue blind tasting bottled still waters f
 rom neutral to mineral-rich\, then crack open a whole bunch of sparkling s
 oda waters and go through them one-by-one.\n\nThis low-pressure and friend
 ly tasting is perfect for curious drinkers\, food lovers\, coffee snobs\, 
 supertasters\, sober folks\, and people with strong opinions about H2O. Ma
 ny attendees walk away with a new favorite brand. Skeptics leave convinced
  that water has plenty of flavor.\n\n$55\n\nTickets: https://classbento.co
 m/international-bottled-water-tasting-class-san-francisco\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/international-bottled-water-tasting-class
 -tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34305742/d8b2b528-e51d-413f-9179-91c4abd01307.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Alcademics\, 57 Post Street\, Suite 608\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94
 104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/international-bottled-water-tas
 ting-class-tickets
END:VEVENT
