DESCRIPTION:Fisherman's Wharf Community Benefit District\, Into The Street
 s SF & The Port of San Francisco Present\n\nFisherman's Wharf Chowder Fest
  2026\nSaturday\, October 24 | Little Embarcadero\, Fisherman's Wharf\n\nC
 lam chowder in a sourdough bowl\, steps from Fisherman’s Wharf iconic pi
 ers — this October\, that's the whole afternoon. The Fisherman's Wharf C
 howder Fest brings 8–12 local restaurants together to compete for the ti
 tle of San Francisco's Best Clam Chowder\, judged live on the waterfront.\
 n\nFree to attend — watch the competition\, shop the marketplace\, enjoy
  free activities and catch the entertainment at no cost.\n\nWant to taste 
 the best clam chowder in San Francisco yourself? Grab a Taster's Pass whil
 e supplies last!\n\nWhat to Expect\n\nLive chowder competition — 8–12 
 SF restaurants go head-to-head for San Francisco's Best Clam Chowder\, Bes
 t Theme & Display\, and the People's Choice.\nJudged live — San Francisc
 o culinary tastemakers score every entry right in front of the crowd.\nYou
 r vote counts — Ticket holders vote for People's Choice via QR code.\nMa
 rketplace & outdoor bars — food\, drink\, and retail vendors line the Wh
 arf all afternoon.\nLive entertainment — enjoy live music\, demonstratio
 ns\, and competition updates from the host and judges\nFree activities —
  photo ops\, workshops\, and lawn games\, all included with general admiss
 ion.\n\nGrab Your Pass\nSAVE 25% WITH THE TASTER'S HUNGRY PASS 5-PACK\nGra
 b 5 Taster’s Hungry Passes together and save 25%—because everything ta
 stes better with friend...\n\nFree\nFisherman's Wharf Community Benefit Di
 strict\, Into The Streets SF & The Port of San Francisco Present\n\nTicket
 s: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2
