DESCRIPTION:“Manny’s Neighborhood Trash Cleanup” w/ $1 Beer & Free Y
 oga Classes\, Free Fries (SF)\nManny's\nTired? Sunday Funday. Wired? Sunda
 y done-day. Make our neighborhood better\, brunch with cool people (sorry 
 not sorry\, we’re biased)\, get deals to some fave local spots\, and wra
 p it up before the Sunday Scaries hit with an easy hour of picking up tras
 h around our neighborhood with friends and the community!\nRSVP to save yo
 ur spot\nSF Public Works\, TogetherSF\, Shine On SF\, and Manny’s is hos
 ting a weekly neighborhood trash pick up to help keep our area clean and n
 eat.\n\nBy picking up with us\, you’ll get a special certificate that in
 cludes a whole host of neighborhood discounts valid that day\, including:\
 n\n$3 well highballs and $1 PBRs – Blondies\nHalf price shots (specific 
 shots only) – Bond Bar\nFree Tasty Small Fries – Beehive Bar\nOne free
  Yoga Class – HAUM Yoga\nOne free Yoga Class – Love Story Yoga\n2 for 
 1 empanadas – Venga Empanadas\nOne drink ticket (beer or wine) – Curio
  Bar\nFree Small Hot Chocolate – Dandelion Chocolate\n2 for 1 draft beer
  – Standard Deviant\nFrozen margarita with any additional purchase – W
 est of Pecos\nPlease note that the discounts might vary!\n\nWe’ll provid
 e the gear. All you need to bring is yourself(and maybe the two or three f
 riends you get to sign up to enjoy those 2-1 empanadas). When we’re done
 \, and before you settle in for those dollar margs\, join us for brunch to
  support Farming Hope – the non-profit restaurant at Manny’s! Don’t 
 forget to bring layers and comfo...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://refuserefu
 sesf.org/cleanups\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/mannys-neighborhood-tr
 ash-cleanup-w-1-beer-free-yoga-classes-free-fries-sf-155/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
