DESCRIPTION:The Bay Area’s biggest dumpling party is back.\n\nSan Franci
 sco’s World of Dumplings returns to the Ferry Building on Sunday\, Octob
 er 25 for a free\, all-day celebration of dumplings\, food\, culture and c
 ommunity.\n\nMore than 16\,000 people attended last year\, with 45+ local 
 restaurants and businesses taking part. This year’s festival will return
  with dumplings from across cultures\, cooking demos\, live performances\,
  community programming and more.\n\nWorld of Dumplings is produced by Asia
 ns Are Strong\, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit\, and is 100% volunteer-run.\n\nCome
  hungry\, bring friends and spend the day at one of San Francisco’s larg
 est community food gatherings of the fall.\n\nSunday\, October 25\, 2026\n
 11am–5pm\nFerry Building / Ferry Plaza\, San Francisco\nFree admission\n
 \nAdvance registration is encouraged.\n\nRegister:\nWorld of Dumplings 202
 6\n\nMeet Big Dumpling:\nWatch the World of Dumplings promo reel\n\nFree\n
