DESCRIPTION:SF’s Free Arcade Game Night at The Detour (First Tuesdays)\n
 The Detour\nPaid rent in SF? Hella Broke? Then first Tuesdays are the nigh
 t for you. The Detour hosts “Free Play Tuesday” with all arcade games 
 on free play with purchase from the bar. Come enjoy all the video game glo
 ry from today and yesteryear while enjoying delicious craft beer & cocktai
 ls.\nFree Play Tuesdays\nFirst Tuesday of the Month (4pm ’til Midnight)\
 nThe Detour\, 2200 Market St\, SF\nFREE unlimited play wristband with any 
 drink/food purchase from bar – includes all 40+ video games plus two fea
 tured pinball machines.\n\nFree Play Tuesday resumed on August 3\, 2021 
 – confirmed on 12/7/21\nProof of vaccination required for indoor dining/
 drinking/gaming\nMasks are required when not actively eating or drinking i
 ndoors\n\nHappy Hour is 4-6pm (M-F) with $8 Beer and a shot (Holy Ghost Pi
 lsner & Fernet\, Tecate & Tequila or KSA Kolsh & Bourbon) plus Well Drink 
 $7 (1 liquor + 1 mixer) or $1 off Specialty Cocktails – Skill Shot and Y
 oung Buck plus Red Blend\, Sauvignon Blanc\, Draft Beers (please note the 
 happy hour was last confirmed in August 2021.\n\nArcade Game Lineup\nSubje
 ct to change Play games like Time Crisis 2\, The Simpsons\, 10-player Kill
 er Queen\, Buck Hunter HD Wild\, Ms. Pac Man\, Paper Boy\, Mortal Kombat 3
 \, pinball games like Adams Family and Game of Thrones\, classic multicade
  gaemes and lots more. Plus the pinball line up has been expanded with the
  addition of The Mandelorian – Check out The Detour’s pinball and arca
 de game...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.detoursf.com/event/free-play-tu
 esday/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-free-arcade-game-night-at-the
 -detour-first-tuesdays-61/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/The-De
 tour.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Detour SF\, 2200 Market St #A San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-free-arcade-game-night-at-the-detour-first
 -tuesdays-61/
