 Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato (Every Friday)Fri 11/6 “Pay-
 What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato (Ever...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https
 ://www.facebook.com/tatosf/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/pay-what-you
 -can-taco-day-at-sfs-tato-every-friday-304/\nSource: Funcheap SF
